      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "I will say that the Mythos security freakout from Anthropic, much derided at the time, and the focus on first deploying cyber models with limited access from the Labs seems to have been an effective step in mitigating some of the downside cyber risk that would have otherwise happened from AI.",
